From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libeffects: gate loadViperEffect on persist.eos.v4a.off

Allow disabling ViPER4Android HIDL driver loading on cheetah via the same
persist.eos.v4a.off recovery kill-switch used by the Pixel 11 aidl-overlay
devices. When persist.eos.v4a.off is non-zero (1 = manual off, 2 = auto off),
return early from loadViperEffect() before dlopen().
---
 media/libeffects/factory/EffectsFactory.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/media/libeffects/factory/EffectsFactory.c b/media/libeffects/factory/EffectsFactory.c
index 2ae304e000..f8a4b21000 100644
--- a/media/libeffects/factory/EffectsFactory.c
+++ b/media/libeffects/factory/EffectsFactory.c
@@ -645,6 +645,12 @@ void loadViperEffect() {
     const char *libPath = NULL;
     lib_entry_t *registeredLib = NULL;
 
+    // Recovery/user kill-switch (parity with Pixel 11 aidl-overlay persist.eos.v4a.off)
+    if (property_get_int32("persist.eos.v4a.off", 0) != 0) {
+        ALOGI("loadViperEffect: disabled via persist.eos.v4a.off, skipping");
+        return;
+    }
+
     // An audio_effects.xml entry (e.g. from a ViPER module) may have registered it already
     if (findEffect(NULL, &kViperImplUuid, &registeredLib, NULL) == 0) {
         ALOGI("loadViperEffect: ViPER effect already registered by library %s, skipping",
-- 
